  "body": [
    "Be the First Choice for All Groundbreakers",
    "Doosan Bobcat is dedicated to strengthening its leadership position across its entire product portfolio. To achieve sustainable growth, the company prioritizes diversifying its product offerings and globalizing its footprint, all while delivering innovative products and services.",
    "As the inventor of the world's first skid-steer loader, Doosan Bobcat is a leading global manufacturer and distributor of premium brands leading multiple industry segments.",
    "We invented the original skid- steer loader and produced our millionth loader in 2014. More Bobcat® skid-steer loaders are at work around the world than all the other brands combined.",
    "We offer the most attachments (100+ categories) in the industry.",
    "We have 1500+ dealerships in North America, delivering industry-leading support to customers in their local communities.",
    "We introduced the world's first all-electric compact loaders, as we innovate for the future.",
    "Doosan Bobcat builds the most reliable compact equipment and attachments to help customers conquer their toughest jobs.",
    "Compact Equipment Doosan Bobcat leads the industry in the design, manufacturing, marketing and distribution of compact equipment for construction, landscaping, agriculture, grounds maintenance, utility and mining industries. Committed to empowering people to accomplish more, Doosan Bobcat is dedicated to building stronger communities for a better tomorrow. Learn more Learn more",
    "Material Handling We emphasizes operator convenience, equipment performance and eco-friendly features such as reduced noise and emissions. Learn more Learn more",
    "Portable Power We provides durable and reliable air compressors, generators and light towers that are built to last, easy to operate and ready to perform on demand. Learn more Learn more",
    "Doosan Bobcat is committed to a strong economic future, while also evolving in bold ways to meet our customers’ toughest challenges and offer solutions for a more sustainable future.",
    "Environmental",
